From 8dd7d30cba938e20635b24c46e080177d501e05e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nyasha <nmushambi@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:36:38 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 06/29] Remove the display bring-up diagnostics

- Drop the register dumps, boot-state snapshots, forced values and delayed
  work added while chasing the black panel
- Delete the unused panel retry work and the stale brightness-latching
  comment and flag left from the host-mode workaround
- No functional change: console then full white still confirmed on hardware

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code with DeepSeek Flash v4.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
